# --- Original retail files: NOT redistributed in this repo ---
# Missile Attack! (c) 1992 Peter Siamidis. Released as $5 shareware, which is
# not public domain -- nothing here transfers any right to the original code.
# Bring your own copy and drop it in original/ yourself; the pipeline reads it
# from there. Everything under game/ and disc/ is unpacked from that copy and
# is equally not ours to ship.
